# bits/ffi - bit operations over non-negative integral numbers

@func bit_and
@template "bit_and(a, b)"
@help "Returns the bitwise AND of two non-negative integers."

@func bit_or
@template "bit_or(a, b)"
@help "Returns the bitwise OR of two non-negative integers."

@func bit_xor
@template "bit_xor(a, b)"
@help "Returns the bitwise XOR of two non-negative integers."

@func bit_not
@template "bit_not(a, width)"
@help "Complements the low width bits of a."

@func shl
@template "shl(a, count)"
@help "Shifts a non-negative integer left by count bits."

@func shr
@template "shr(a, count)"
@help "Logically shifts a non-negative integer right by count bits."

@func mask
@template "mask(width)"
@help "Returns a value whose low width bits are 1."

@func low
@template "low(a, width)"
@help "Returns the low width bits of a."

@func extract
@template "extract(a, start, width)"
@help "Extracts width bits beginning at bit start."

@func replace
@template "replace(a, start, width, value)"
@help "Replaces width bits beginning at bit start."
